@startuml
title P1 macOS local self-test and short-file intake

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
component "PulsarSelfTestView\nSwiftUI picker + drop" as View
component "PulsarShellModel / Actions\n@MainActor projection" as Shell
component "MacLocalSelfTestService\nserial local lifecycle" as Service
component "MacMicrophoneCaptureEngine\nTCC + bounded capture" as Capture
component "MacShortAudioInspector / Intake\nprobe + canonicalize" as Intake
database "CaptureMediaStore\nowner-only drafts" as Store
component "MacProductionLocalClipOutput" as LocalOutput
component "MacOverlayMediaClipMixer\nproduction clip branch" as Mixer
component "Selected AudioEngine output" as Output

User --> View : cue / 5 s record / pick / drop / delete
View --> Shell : explicit actions
Shell --> Service : later integration binding
Service --> Capture : begin, start cue complete, stop, cancel
Service --> Intake : review then explicit accept
Capture --> Store : finalized microphone draft
Intake --> Store : canonical durable-unsent draft
Service --> LocalOutput : cue or completed draft only
LocalOutput --> Mixer
Mixer --> Output

note right of Service
No URLSession
No CoordinatorClient
No upload state transition
No telemetry client
end note

note bottom of Intake
50 MiB / 180 s P1 gate
overlay eligible through 60 s
server probe remains authoritative
end note

@enduml
